data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": "{\n  \"name\": \"rb_sas_", "n_tokens_so_far": 11, "tps": null}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": "1inch_mounted_optics\",\n  \"description\": \"Rubidium (780 nm) saturated-absorption", "n_tokens_so_far": 35, "tps": 142.4}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": "{\"name\":\"rb_sas_1inch", "n_tokens_so_far": 9, "tps": null}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " spectroscopy module with 1-inch mounted optics. Input beam passes through a half-wave plate (HWP1) and polarizing beamsplit", "n_tokens_so_far": 63, "tps": 103.2}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": "_mounted\",\"description\":\"Saturated absorption spectroscopy (SAS) setup for Rb D2 (780 nm) using 1", "n_tokens_so_far": 35, "tps": 130.1}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": "ter (PBS1), picking off a vertical-polarized branch while the main H-polarized beam passes through. The branch", "n_tokens_so_far": 87, "tps": 89.4}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": "-inch mounted optics. Input beam passes through a half-wave plate (HWP1) and polarizing beamsplitter (PBS1), picking off a", "n_tokens_so_far": 66, "tps": 104.5}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " reflects off mirror M1 into a 90:10 beam sampler (BS). The 10% reflected beam becomes", "n_tokens_so_far": 113, "tps": 93.0}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " the probe, rotated from V to H polarization by HWP2, folded via mirrors M2 and M3 through the Rb", "n_tokens_so_far": 138, "tps": 94.7}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": " spectroscopy branch. A beam sampler (BS) divides the branch into a 10% reflected probe arm (rotated to H by HWP2", "n_tokens_so_far": 95, "tps": 95.5}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " vapor cell (CELL) and transmitted through PBS2 onto photodiode PD. The 90% transmitted beam becomes the counter-propagating pump,", "n_tokens_so_far": 167, "tps": 91.8}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": ", steered via M2 and M3 through the Rb vapor cell and PBS2 onto photodiode PD) and a 90% transmitted pump arm (", "n_tokens_so_far": 125, "tps": 92.1}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " steered via M4, optional HWP3 (at 0 deg to maintain V polarization), and M5 into PBS2, which", "n_tokens_so_far": 194, "tps": 100.0}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": "steered via M4, HWP3, and M5 to PBS2, which reflects the V-polarized pump counter", "n_tokens_so_far": 150, "tps": 93.8}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " reflects the V-polarized pump into the Rb cell to overlap the probe; after counter-propagating through the cell, M", "n_tokens_so_far": 219, "tps": 100.4}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": "-propagating through the Rb cell). Unused pass-through and counter-propagating pump beams are caught by beam dumps.\",\"baseplate\":{\"width_", "n_tokens_so_far": 180, "tps": 91.8}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": "3, M2, and HWP2 (which rotates it to H), the spent pump transmits through BS and is caught", "n_tokens_so_far": 244, "tps": 96.0}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-2", "call_id": "synth1#0-9", "kind": "output", "text": "mm\":485.0,\"height_mm\":185.0,\"thickness_mm\":25", "n_tokens_so_far": 204, "tps": 98.0}

data: {"type": "tokens", "agent_id": "synth-1", "call_id": "synth0#0-8", "kind": "output", "text": " by a beam dump.\",\n  \"baseplate\": {\n    \"width_mm\": 485.0,\n    \"", "n_tokens_so_far": 273, "tps": 98.0}

