data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-2", "text": "Drafted 'rb_sas_1inch_mounted' on a 485x185 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x half wave plate, 2x pbs, 2x beam dump, 1x sampler, 1x vapor cell, 1x photodiode. Saturated absorption spectroscopy (SAS) setup for Rb D2 (780 nm) using 1-inch mounted optics. Input beam passes through a half-wave plate (HWP1) and polarizing beamsplitter (PBS1), picking off a spectroscopy branch. A beam sampler (BS) divides the bra"}

