sorption spectroscopy layout. HWP1 at 15 deg sends ~25% (5 mW) V-polarized light into the spectroscopy branch via PBS1. BS reflects 10% (0.5 mW) into the probe arm and transmits 90% (4.5 mW) into the pump arm. HWP2 at 45 deg rotates the probe polarization from V to H so that it transmits through CELL (60% transmission -> 0.3 mW) and PBS2 onto PD. The V-polarized pump reflects at M4, passes through optional HWP3 (fast axis 0 deg, keeping V), reflects at M5 (+y), and reflects at PBS2 (+x) to counter-propagate through CELL overlap with the probe, terminating in BD_pump after M3.", "logic": null}, "trace": {"segments": [{"id": "s0", "branch": "IN", "source_id": "IN", "start": [443.0, 25.0], "end": [443.0, 95.0], "direction_deg": 90.0, "length_mm": 70.0, "wavelength_nm": 780.24, "freq_shift_mhz": 0.0, "power_mw": 20.0, "jones": [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 0.0]], "polarization_label": "H", "waist_z_mm": 0.0, "rayleigh_mm": 2576.924149361053, "w0_mm": 0.8, "w_start_mm": 0.8, "w_end_mm": 0.8002951023765144, "start_element": "IN", "end_element": "HWP1", "end_reason": "element"}, {"id": "s1", "branch": "IN", "source_id": "IN", "start": [443.0, 95.0], "end": [443.0, 150.0], "direction_deg": 90.0, "length_mm": 54.99999999999999, "wavelength_nm": 780.24, "freq_shift_mhz": 0.0, "power_mw": 20.0, "jones": [[0.8660254037844387, 0.0], [0.49999999999999994, -3.5352507957496895e-17]], "polarization_label": "linear 30\u00b0", "waist_z_mm": -70.0, "rayleigh_mm": 2576.924149361053, "w0_mm": 0.8, "w_start_mm": 0.8002951023765144, "w_end_mm": 0.800940635793816, "start_element": "HWP1", "end_element": "PBS1", "end_reason": "element"}, {"id": "s2", "branch": "IN.t", "source_id": "IN", "start": [443.0, 150.0], "end": [443.0, 178.0], "direction_deg": 90.0, "length_mm": 28.0, "wavelength_nm": 780.24, "freq_shift_mhz": 0.0, "power_mw": 15.000000000000002, "jones": [[1.0, 0.0], [0.0, 0.0]], "polarization_label": "H", "waist_z_mm": -125.0, "rayleigh_mm": 2576.924149361053, "w0_mm": 0.8, "w_start_mm": 0.800